---

The isotope masses and abundances in mass_spec/isotopes.py come from NIST
"Atomic Weights and Isotopic Compositions for All Elements", a work of the
U.S. Government (public domain in the United States).

This plugin does not include ProteoWizard or any vendor library. It reads
Bruker .d data (analysis.baf) itself and does not use, modify or decompile any
Bruker program. For measurements it cannot read, it may call msconvert from a
ProteoWizard installation that each user installs separately under
ProteoWizard's own license and the vendor license terms they accept when
downloading it. Bruker and micrOTOF are trademarks of Bruker; this plugin is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Bruker.
